sequenceDiagram
  participant YF as Yahoo Finance
  participant NB as Jupyter / train_btc
  participant ART as btc_model.joblib
  participant API as Container FastAPI
  participant PM as Postman

  NB->>YF: download BTC-USD (2021-10-05..2026-10-05)
  YF-->>NB: histórico de preços
  NB->>NB: treina LinearRegression
  NB->>ART: joblib.dump
  Note over ART,API: COPY no Dockerfile (build da imagem)
  ART->>API: artefato disponível no container
  PM->>API: GET /health
  API-->>PM: status ok
  PM->>API: POST /predict (close, return_1d, ma_7)
  API->>API: carrega modelo e prediz
  API-->>PM: prediction (close de amanhã)
